    <h3 class="body-subhead">Protecting cutting edge technologies</h3>
    
    <p>Kohlerackles&rsquo; Life Sciences team is known for developing and implementing effective IP strategies and building strong patent portfolios. These practices protect and facilitate commercialization of products for companies ranging from biotechnology start-ups to leading pharmaceutical companies.</p>
    
