    						<div class="col-md-8">
    							<h3 class="top-body-subhead">We help clients at every stage of development</h3>
    
    <ul class="collapseList collapseTo_5">
    	<li>Global strategic counseling</li>
    	<li>IP portfolio development</li>
    	<li>International filing strategies</li>
    	<li>Patent preparation and prosecution</li>
    	<li>Reexamination, opposition, reissue, interference, and inter partes review proceedings, as well as third-party submissions</li>
    	<li>Validity and non-infringement opinions</li>
    	<li>Financing due diligence and opinions</li>
    	<li>FDA patent listings and extensions</li>
    	<li>Licensing and transactions</li>
    	<li>Litigation and enforcement</li>
    	<li>Trademarks and copyright</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h3 class="body-subhead">A multidisciplinary team of legal and technical professionals</h3>
    
    <ul>
    	<li>Our senior partners have more than 25 years of experience in the biologics field</li>
    	<li>Our group includes patent attorneys, litigators and technical specialists</li>
    	<li>Members of our team have Ph.D.s and Master&rsquo;s Degrees in molecular biology, cell biology, biochemistry, medical microbiology, molecular genetics, immunology, and virology</li>
    	<li>Nationally recognized by leading publications, including Chambers USA, US News&ndash;Best Law Firms, and Managing Intellectual Property</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h3 class="body-subhead">Our clients range from start-ups to leading pharmaceutical companies</h3>
    
    <ul>
    	<li>Biotechnology start-ups</li>
    	<li>Global pharmaceutical companies</li>
    	<li>Leading academic and research institutions</li>
    	<li>Medical device companies</li>
    	<li>Healthcare service companies</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h3 class="body-subhead">Protecting cutting edge technologies</h3>
    
    <p>Kohlerackles&rsquo; Life Sciences team is known for developing and implementing effective IP strategies and building strong patent portfolios. These practices protect and facilitate commercialization of products for companies ranging from biotechnology start-ups to leading pharmaceutical companies.</p>
    
    <h3 class="body-subhead">Our life sciences services help&nbsp;you to</h3>
    
    <ul>
    	<li><strong>Take your product from&nbsp;innovation through FDA approval&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>helping large and small clients at every stage of development, including IP strategies, worldwide patent portfolios, freedom to operate, financing, licensing and enforcement</li>
    	<li><strong>Strategically develop global IP portfolios&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>including expanding patent portfolios for product lines, obtaining broad protection for next-generation technologies and positioning portfolios for future worldwide commercial development</li>
    	<li><strong>Identify, assess and address the risks of patent</strong> <strong>litigation&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>enabling life science companies to make informed business decisions when enforcing or defending their IP in the U.S. or around the world</li>
    	<li><strong>Complete fundraising transactions&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>working with biotechnology companies and venture capitalist, we conduct the IP due diligence clients need to confidently move forward with public offerings, initial public offerings and other fundraising transactions</li>
    	<li><strong>Close multi-million dollar acquisitions&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;</strong>representing pharmaceutical companies and start-ups, our attorneys and technical specialist conduct IP due diligence and advise clients on the strength of patent portfolios related to multi-million dollar acquisitions&nbsp;</li>
    </ul>
